{
  "name": "luapgsql",
  "description": "A lightweight and idiomatic Lua binding for the PostgreSQL libpq C library, facilitating high-performance database interactions through the Lua C API. It provides managed connection and result objects with automatic garbage collection, supporting advanced features such as parametrized queries, asynchronous NOTIFY events, and efficient result set iteration. The implementation handles type-aware data marshalling between PostgreSQL OIDs and native Lua types, ensuring robust integration with relational backends.",
